==Description==
The '''Mushrooms Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 29 of the regular [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{Bunz|980}} or {{Robux|118}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Bunz|13,490}} or {{Robux|2,685}}.

The '''Mushrooms Nametag''' has white text with a bright red diagonal gradient and a darker red outline. Red mushrooms and circular particles emit from the text. A dark red smoke is seen behind the text.

